ted felt cutout fantasy with gentle emotion, cozy adventure, and soft cinematic storybook energy using the F3ltCut0u7 handcrafted felt cutout diorama style.\n\nCOLOR PALETTE\nSoft sky blue, warm cream, pastel gold, peach, light lavender, mint green, and bright stitched accents with clean colorful layers.\n\nLIGHTING / MOOD\nSoft glowing light with bright gentle contrast, cozy shadows, dreamy nighttime warmth, and calm uplifting mood.\n\n\ntext prompt to convert: \n",
